{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44743","headline":"题黄公陶翰别业 · 灵一","name":"题黄公陶翰别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻说花源堪避秦，幽寻数月不逢人。\n烟霞洞里无鸡犬，风雨林间有鬼神。\n黄公石上三芝秀，陶令门前五柳春。\n醉卧白云闲入梦，不知何物是吾身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}